---
layout: null
permalink: /sitemap.xml
---
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<urlset xmlns="http://www.sitemaps.org/schemas/sitemap/0.9">
{%- comment -%}
Bewusst kuratierte Sitemap (statt jekyll-sitemap):
nur Landingpages (start + skript je Lernbereich) und zentrale Seiten.
App-Module (training, recall, feynman, flashcards, kompetenzliste, warmup)
haben Canonical auf start und gehören nicht hierher.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign root_pages = "/,/index.html,/material.html,/konzept.html,/ueber-mich.html,/impressum.html,/datenschutz.html" | split: "," -%}
{%- for p in site.pages -%}
{%- if p.noindex -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- assign include_page = false -%}
{%- if root_pages contains p.url -%}
{%- assign include_page = true -%}
{%- elsif p.module_key == "start" or p.module_key == "skript" -%}
{%- assign include_page = true -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- if include_page %}
  <url>
    <loc>{{ p.url | replace: "index.html", "" | prepend: site.url }}</loc>
  </url>
{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor %}
</urlset>
